# INT-421 + INT-378: the staff Keycloak image's build context. Deny everything, then admit the
# provider module and its jar pin. A local build's target/ never travels: the image builds its
# own jar and checks it against the pin.
*
!infra/keycloak/providers/webauthn-session-notes.sha256
!infra/keycloak/providers/webauthn-session-notes
infra/keycloak/providers/webauthn-session-notes/target
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
